WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.280
- Are you going to get a
chance to sing on the show?

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:03.401
Is my question.

00:00:03.401 --> 00:00:04.760
- The "Grownish" show or this show?

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:05.593
- No "Grownish"

00:00:05.593 --> 00:00:06.426
- Oh all right.

00:00:06.426 --> 00:00:07.259
- All right, this show too!

00:00:07.259 --> 00:00:08.092
What!

00:00:08.092 --> 00:00:08.925
Get a mike!

00:00:08.925 --> 00:00:09.758
(laughing)

00:00:09.758 --> 00:00:10.785
- No I don't sing on grownish.

00:00:10.785 --> 00:00:11.618
- You don't?

00:00:11.618 --> 00:00:12.950
- My character would not do that.

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:13.783
- He would not?

00:00:13.783 --> 00:00:15.330
Okay, maybe you just work it in somehow.

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:16.990
Maybe you surprise people, yeah.

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:17.950
I'm just saying you're really good at it.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:19.227
- Sit on the toilet or something.

00:00:19.227 --> 00:00:20.060
(audience laughing)

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:21.014
- [Kelly] In the shower.

00:00:21.014 --> 00:00:21.847
(laughing)

00:00:21.847 --> 00:00:22.838
- I love that you went with the toilet

00:00:22.838 --> 00:00:23.671
instead of the shower.

00:00:23.671 --> 00:00:24.504
- I don't know why!

00:00:24.504 --> 00:00:25.389
- Hey I love the toilet,
that's the best place.

00:00:25.389 --> 00:00:26.222
You got a lot of time.
- Yes.

00:00:26.222 --> 00:00:28.330
I find a lot of inspiration sitting there.

00:00:28.330 --> 00:00:29.163
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:00:29.163 --> 00:00:30.102
- [Kelly] You know why?

00:00:30.102 --> 00:00:31.361
'Cause as a parent, it's
your only alone time.

00:00:31.361 --> 00:00:32.194
(laughing)

00:00:32.194 --> 00:00:33.027
- Only alone time!

00:00:33.027 --> 00:00:35.000
- It's like, I stay in there
way longer than I need to.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:35.853
- [Trevor] Yeah, yeah.

00:00:35.853 --> 00:00:36.999
- "Still working it out!"

00:00:36.999 --> 00:00:38.127
(laughing)

